  "details": "The current Config File restriction VRChat to 8K Photo and 4K Spout Stream.\n\nThis is enough for many users, but if want to shoot at a higher resolution, will need a huge monitor.\n\nIf can remove the Config File restriction, can take 16K Photos without having to prepare a huge monitor, and easily record 8K videos with the Spout Stream function.\n\nPlease consider it.\n\n--------\n\nI take high-resolution photos and videos https://youtu.be/BHu5Cw28Nws\n\nright-click on the first attached image and select \"Open image in new tab\", can see that I took a 16K resolution photo.",
